          },
          "committer": {
            "name": "Marcus Huderle",
            "email": "huderlem@gmail.com",
            "date": "2023-03-31T17:14:12Z"
          },
          "message": "Remove problematic opacity style from container animatedStyle.\n\nThis style was originally added to address some lingering-sheet behavior, however, it seems that it also causes some kind of race condition or Reanimated bug. The presence of this opacity rule can cause the container to disappear on occasion. Others independently discovered the same problem here: https://github.com/gorhom/react-native-bottom-sheet/issues/719#issuecomment-1193175586\n\nSince we can't seem to trigger the original problematic behavior, we are reverting this opacity rule.",
          "tree": {
